// The document-wide index of paragraph i's run number k, which is what
// odt_run_text and odt_run_style take. Runs are numbered across the whole
// document rather than within a paragraph so that a renderer laying out a page
// can hold one cursor instead of two.
odt_run_at(int i, int k) {
  int ret_i = (import odt_plo)[i] + k;
} return int ret_i;
